    "title": "HomeNode device approval API",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Implemented device approval slice only. Other HomeNode endpoints remain outside this document pending complete API contract work. Production requires trusted HTTPS and Strict Secure HttpOnly __Host-homenode sessions; development uses homenode-dev on localhost."
